  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Connecting Blue Economy Actors: Generating Employment, Supporting Livelihoods and Mobilizing Resources</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This inter-agency initiative aims at unleashing the potential of the Blue Economy in Cabo Verde as an accelerator of the Sustainable Development Goals and an engine of socio-economic inclusion for the poor coastal communities in the island of Santiago, Cabo Verde, especially women and youth. To do so, the project will bring together different stakeholders of the blue economy, including local private sector and diaspora to provide the skills and equipment needed to enhance socioeconomic inclusion in a thriving, sustainable and just blue economy.</narrative>
  </description>
